  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v4.0.0 - Major Release (Modular Architecture)\n- ✅ Modular folder structure for maintainability\n- ✅ AES-256-GCM encryption for secure local storage\n- ✅ RSA signature verification (RSASSA-PKCS1-v1_5 with SHA-256)\n- ✅ Advanced hardware binding (none/loose/strict modes)\n- ✅ Clock tampering detection\n- ✅ Hybrid validation (offline-first with background checks)\n- ✅ IntegrityGuard with anti-debugging and anti-tampering\n- ✅ Multiple validation strategies (online-only, offline-only, hybrid, adaptive)\n- ✅ Trial activation methods\n- ✅ Analytics and feature usage tracking\n- ✅ License installation from file\n- ✅ Improved grace period handling\n- ✅ Cross-framework support (.NET 8.0, Framework 4.8, Standard 2.0)",
